Third-party data
----------------
The licence above covers only the author's own work. The data the map is
built from keeps its own licence and attribution, which must be kept in any
copy or derivative:

  - swisstopo open geodata (swissALTI3D, swissSURFACE3D, SWISSIMAGE,
    swissBUILDINGS3D, swissTLM3D, swissNAMES3D): (c) swisstopo.
  - Official cadastral survey of Canton Ticino (Ufficio del catasto e dei
    riordini fondiari, via geodienste.ch).
  - Federal Register of Buildings and Dwellings (Federal Statistical Office).
  - OpenStreetMap: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors. The OpenStreetMap
    extracts in beamng/dati/osm_*.json.gz are made available under the Open
    Database License (ODbL) 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/),
    not under CC BY-NC 4.0.
  - Copernicus DEM GLO-30: (c) DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and (c) Airbus Defence and
    Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and
    ESA.
  - Google Street View: the panorama metadata in the repository root
    (panoramas*.json, panoramas.csv, panoramas.geojson, cameras.json) refers
    to Google imagery and is subject to Google's terms. No Street View image
    is distributed.
  - BeamNG.drive and its vanilla assets belong to BeamNG GmbH. The mod only
    references them and does not include them; using the mod also requires
    following BeamNG's own terms.

This is a fan project, not affiliated with BeamNG GmbH, swisstopo, Canton
Ticino or Google.
